WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:07,960
uncle

2
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:11,030
I have something to tell you, uncle

3
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:13,430
Lao Lao said that you go to sea every day now

4
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:15,430
Can you call me when you go out to sea tonight?

5
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:18,770
Your kid is only in the second grade of junior high school, right?

6
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:20,170
Don’t want to go to school well

7
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:21,570
Why do you think you have all these things?

8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,200
This is not something that exists

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,200
I don’t know how long it will take for dad’s injury to heal.

10
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,000
We can't always rely on you, uncle, to get close.

11
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,600
I want to make money myself

12
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,800
Feed my parents, you are still young

13
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,400
I don’t know that going to school is the right way

14
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,600
As for living expenses, I'll be there

15
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,200
Uncle, you and your family of three can't be hungry.

16
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,200
There are a total of forty-five people in our class

17
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,800
I'm the last one every time

18
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,000
Going to school means nothing to me

19
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,000
I want to go to sea and make money

20
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,400
If you don't promise me

21
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,600
I would go to the dock and work as a casual worker to unload cargo.

22
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:53,060
Anyway, I don’t want to take this course. I don’t believe it.

23
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,460
You can also tie me to school

24
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:57,130
Then I'll give you a break from school first

25
00:00:57,330 --> 00:00:58,530
You go out to sea with me a few times first

26
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:07,320
If you can't stand it anymore, go back to school, sis.

27
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,320
This guy Su Yuan wants to go to sea with me.

28
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:10,920
Say you and your brother-in-law agreed

29
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:16,750
Su Yuan's grades were not good to begin with.

30
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:19,350
If he wants to go, just let him go.

31
00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:20,550
From then on, every time I went to sea

32
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:21,950
I give Li Suyuan two yuan as salary

33
00:01:22,150 --> 00:01:23,550
If two people go to an isolated island to catch the sea

34
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:24,750
Personal surplus belongs to the individual

35
00:01:24,950 --> 00:01:28,150
If it's fishing on a boat, etc., the goods will be mine.
